cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research project, please cite it as follows."
title: "Deep Learning-Based Fake Social Media Profile Detection Using ResNet-50, Image Normalization, and Metaheuristic Optimization"
authors:
  - family-names: "Abuamer"
    given-names: "Ahmed J. M."
abstract: >-
  A Master's research project investigating image-based fake social
  media profile classification using a pretrained ResNet-50 model,
  ten image normalization techniques, and five independently
  implemented metaheuristic optimization algorithms. The research
  evaluates four profile-image categories: Bot, Cyborg, Real, and
  Verified.
type: thesis
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/9ahmed163788-cyber/FakeProfileDetection"
